# Everything that must never reach the build context.
#
# .dockerignore matters more than usual here, not just for image size: the build
# stage copies the whole tree in, so anything listed below is visible to every
# `COPY . .` and would be captured in an image layer forever.

# The single most important line in this file.
.env
.env*.local
.env.production

# Written by the local DB bootstrap.
.navika-db-pw

node_modules
.next
.git
build
coverage

# Editor and agent tooling - not part of the app, and large.
.agents
.claude
.windsurf
CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json
.vscode
.idea

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.pem
npm-debug.log*
